{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vJuIHNj0Pi1793787604.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市先跌後顯著回升，成交增加至逾2萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>深圳創業板指數曾經急漲百分之7，收市升逾百分之6，是逾三個月以來最大單日升幅。上證綜合指數以全日高位收市，收市升逾百分之2，是近七個月以來最大單日升幅。</p><p></p><p>據報國家隊入市支持A股。滬深京三市成交突破2萬億元人民幣。貴金屬和半導體板塊造好，招金黃金和四川黃金升停板。白酒、銀行和保險股逆市下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.715495+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:30.877712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:35.653343+00:00","content_hash":"0f1c5e1f20006673d5bd3a8495eacbb6cb2ef48a9213a3c3a55301cb2b368587","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}